    "Manual, webhook, and scheduled syncs share this limit. Extra requests wait in a queue (Queued) until a slot frees. Quitting the app discards the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manual, webhook, and scheduled syncs share this limit. Extra requests wait in a queue (Queued) until a slot frees. Quitting the app discards the queue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手动、Webhook 与计划同步共用此上限。超出的请求会进入队列（显示为「排队中」），直到有空闲槽位。退出应用会丢弃队列。"
